    "https://www.bellevue.edu/student-experience/student-services/career-services/": {
      "title": "careerservices",
      "description": "Career Services | Bellevue University Skip to main content Visit Campus Bruin Support Current Students Login Search Programs Get Started Tuition & Aid Student Experience Why Bellevue Apply Now Apply Now Request Info career services Office Hours: 8 a.m.–5 p.m., Monday – Friday by appointment only Email: careerservices@bellevue.edu Phone: 402-557-7423 Toll-Free: 800-756-7920 ext. 557-7423 Visit our social media pages: Find Opportunities Career Fair Information Employer Career Fair Guide Student Virtual Career Fair Guide Jobs with Handshake Job Search Websites Micro-Internships for Students and Alumni Military Veteran Jobs Job Prep Career Planning Resume and Cover Letters Additional Resources Interview Practice Networking Recruit Career Fair Information Employer Services Posting Jobs with Handshake Posting Micro-Internships Alumni Career Services for Alumni Let’s get to work. If you’re on the hunt for a job or internship, search for opportunities across the United States in Handshake Exploring. We list the most relevant job search websites. Wondering what you can do with a major in…? Discover tools for choosing the right major related to your goals, or possible career options for your chosen major. Don’t list your mom as a reference. When it comes to writing resumes, we’ve done the research — and we’ve seen it all. We’ve created tips and tools on the do’s and don’ts of cover letter and resume writing, references, interviewing, and networking. Practice your skills at one of our career fairs. Coaching for your new career Career Services can help with mock interviews, how to network or how to become more marketable. If you are exploring careers, we’ll help you discover where your interests and strengths lie. Reach us at careerservices@bellevue.edu or 402-557-7423. Help for hiring If you’re an employer looking for qualified prospects, we know where to find them. From hosting events on Handshake to our bi-annual career fair, we’ll help you find the right graduates that are prepared to work for you. Post jobs and internships for free on an online job board dedicated to Bellevue University’s students and alumni. Contact us at careerservices@bellevue.edu about all our services for employers. Apply Now Request Information Programs Bachelor's Master's Certificates Online Programs On-Campus Programs Academic Catalog Tuition & Aid Federal Financial Aid Military Financing Employer Tuition Assistance Scholarships & Grants Transfer Credits Tuition Rates & Fees Experience Athletics Campus Map Career Services Library Military Veteran Services Center Student Services Technical Requirements Why Bellevue About Us Accreditations Awards Our Faculty Events Calendar Blog News Careers at Bellevue Student Login & Help BRUIN Connect Blackboard Email Access Submit a Support Ticket Make a Payment 1000 Galvin Road South Bellevue, Nebraska 68005 402-293-2000 1-800-756-7920 Consumer Information Privacy Cookie Policy Terms and Conditions Accreditation Site Map ©2026 Bellevue University"
    },
