    "https://www.bellevue.edu/bellevue-university-careers/": {
      "title": "build your future while helping othersbuild theirs",
      "description": "Bellevue University Careers | Bellevue University Skip to main content Visit Campus Bruin Support Current Students Login Search Programs Get Started Tuition & Aid Student Experience Why Bellevue Apply Now Apply Now Request Info Home Bellevue University Careers build your future while helping others build theirs At Bellevue University, your work makes an impact—on students, your community, and your own professional journey. why work at Bellevue University? A Great Place to Work—and Grow Working at Bellevue University means being part of a mission-driven, supportive community focused on changing lives through education. As a nonprofit, student-centered university , we are committed not only to student success—but to the success and well-being of our employees. Our culture emphasizes collaboration, innovation, and respect for every individual’s voice . Employees are empowered to contribute ideas, grow professionally, and make a meaningful difference every day. You’ll benefit from a workplace recognized nationally for employee satisfaction, offering: Supportive leadership and a collaborative environment Professional development and mentorship opportunities Flexible work options and a modern workplace approach A comprehensive “whole-person” benefits model focused on wellness, growth, and balance how you can join us... Staff and Professional Careers For professionals ready to make an impact behind the scenes. From operations and student support to technology and leadership roles, Bellevue University staff play a vital role in delivering an exceptional student experience. Join a team that values your expertise and supports your growth through meaningful work and strong benefits. Staff roles (full-time & part-time) Administrative & operational careers Student support & service roles View Staff Openings Faculty Careers For educators, experts, and leaders shaping the future of learning. Bellevue University faculty bring real-world experience into the classroom—teaching, mentoring, and innovating across more than 80 programs. Whether full-time or adjunct, faculty are encouraged to collaborate, explore new teaching approaches, and contribute to program development in a flexible, forward-thinking environment. Our students are primarily working adults—creating a dynamic, engaging teaching experience grounded in real-life application. Full-time faculty Adjunct faculty Program directors & academic leadership roles View Faculty Openings Adjunct Faculty Openings Student Employment For Bellevue students looking to gain experience while earning income. Student employment at Bellevue University offers a flexible way to build skills, earn income, and stay connected to campus life . On-campus jobs are designed to fit your academic schedule while providing valuable experience that supports your career goals. Working on campus can also help you feel more engaged and connected—while strengthening your academic success. On-campus student jobs Federal Work-Study opportunities Part-time student worker roles View Student Jobs find your place at Bellevue University Whether you’re building your career, sharing your expertise, or gaining experience as a student, Bellevue University offers opportunities to grow, contribute, and succeed. Explore Opportunities Questions? Contact us at cabyers@bellevue.edu Equal Opportunity Employer statement Apply Now Request Information Programs Bachelor's Master's Certificates Online Programs On-Campus Programs Academic Catalog Tuition & Aid Federal Financial Aid Military Financing Employer Tuition Assistance Scholarships & Grants Transfer Credits Tuition Rates & Fees Experience Athletics Campus Map Career Services Library Military Veteran Services Center Student Services Technical Requirements Why Bellevue About Us Accreditations Awards Our Faculty Events Calendar Blog News Careers at Bellevue Student Login & Help BRUIN Connect Blackboard Email Access Submit a Support Ticket Make a Payment 1000 Galvin Road South Bellevue, Nebraska 68005 402-293-2000 1-800-756-7920 Consumer Information Privacy Cookie Policy Terms and Conditions Accreditation Site Map ©2026 Bellevue University"
    }
  },
